WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.781 --> 00:00:05.557
- When you tell people that
I run a slot car they go,

00:00:05.557 --> 00:00:06.974
"What, what's that?

00:00:06.974 --> 00:00:09.060
I never heard of that before."

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:13.227
When they first do it they
go, "Wow, this is fun!"

00:00:17.087 --> 00:00:19.087
I am "Buzz" Frank Perri.

00:00:20.247 --> 00:00:22.884
I am the proprietor of Buzz-A-Rama,

00:00:22.884 --> 00:00:25.704
the slot car racing center of the world.

00:00:25.704 --> 00:00:27.132
On your marks,

00:00:27.132 --> 00:00:27.965
get set,

00:00:29.066 --> 00:00:29.899
go!

00:00:32.273 --> 00:00:34.884
Slot car racing is a hobby sport

00:00:34.884 --> 00:00:38.288
that's participated in all over the world.

00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:40.371
In 1965, it was my hobby.

00:00:41.796 --> 00:00:45.008
I was one of the first
to open in New York.

00:00:45.008 --> 00:00:48.428
There was 48 places like this in the city.

00:00:48.428 --> 00:00:49.595
Today, I'm it.

00:00:51.436 --> 00:00:53.269
I'm the lone survivor.

00:00:55.139 --> 00:00:57.531
They have 12 OTC motors in them

00:00:57.531 --> 00:01:00.123
and a guide flag that fits in the slot

00:01:00.123 --> 00:01:02.436
and when you hand control it,

00:01:02.436 --> 00:01:07.315
it energizes those lanes
and gives the motor juice.

00:01:07.315 --> 00:01:12.020
The fastest cars can go
upwards of 100 miles an hour.

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:14.060
So, they're like blurs now.

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:14.992
You have to hear them.

00:01:14.992 --> 00:01:17.256
You go, "Weeng, weeng."

00:01:17.256 --> 00:01:18.652
You can hardly see them,

00:01:18.652 --> 00:01:19.759
you have to listen to them.

00:01:19.759 --> 00:01:21.426
You go, "Wssh, wow!"

00:01:24.105 --> 00:01:26.012
Kids play with computer now

00:01:26.012 --> 00:01:29.787
and there's no interaction with anyone.

00:01:29.787 --> 00:01:33.692
Over here they have
interaction with other drivers,

00:01:33.692 --> 00:01:34.592
they compete,

00:01:34.592 --> 00:01:35.852
they congratulate each other,

00:01:35.852 --> 00:01:37.908
you learn sportsmanship.

00:01:37.908 --> 00:01:39.844
It's really great.

00:01:39.844 --> 00:01:42.560
Just watching the cars
go around the tracks

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:44.324
pumps up your adrenaline

00:01:44.324 --> 00:01:46.368
and you get all excited

00:01:46.368 --> 00:01:49.292
and that thrill never leaves you.

00:01:49.292 --> 00:01:51.459
You always think about it.

